.TH KURUMIFRP 1 "November 2026" "KurumiFrp" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
kurumifrp \- Tokisaki Kurumi themed WebUI controller for official frpc and frps
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kurumifrp
[\fB\-listen\fR \fIaddr\fR]
[\fB\-data\fR \fIdir\fR]
[\fB\-open\fR]
[\fB\-stop\fR]
[\fB\-version\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
KurumiFrp manages multiple independent official frps and frpc configurations and provides a real-time Connection Dashboard in a unified WebUI.
